1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,000
In this tutorial, we will learn how to make the head of the dragon.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Before starting the modeling in Marvelous Designer, I drew the front and side pictures of the dragon's head,

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
to make it easier to create the shape of the dragon's head version more accurately.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Then import this picture as a background picture into the 2D window.

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
First, let's draw the mouth version.

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Use a multidirectional tool to draw the mouth version along the side picture.

7
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:41,000
The concept picture I drew is a draft, and I want to make the width of the lip version more even.

8
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:47,000
So I need to use the edit curve tool to slightly adjust these curve points.

9
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Use the edit curve tool to adjust the curve points,

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
press the bottom button to keep the curve points on both sides not affected.

11
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:59,000
When drawing the lower lip version, we only draw half of the lip version.

12
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Use the edit curve tool to enter the center line on the right-click, select the symmetry to open the edit line.

13
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Then use the adjust curve tool to adjust the size of the lip version.

14
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Then copy and paste a lip version as the upper lip.

15
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Arrange the lip version in the 3D window, pay attention to maintain the connection face direction.

16
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:25,000
I want to make the back of the upper lip version wider, but the front does not need to be modified too much.

17
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Use the add point line tool to add a cut point to the side version to divide the upper and lower lip.

18
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Then use the free-format tool to merge the pieces together.

19
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:49,000
The lip version is shorter than the side of the upper lip version.

20
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:53,000
We need to calculate the length of the missing piece, and lengthen the piece.

21
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:54,000
Select the side of the lip version.

22
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:57,000
On the side of the lip version, press and hold the button to expand the lip version.

23
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:03,000
Enter the difference.

24
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:09,000
Then slightly adjust the extended part.

25
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Then use the edit curve tool to adjust the curve.

26
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:22,000
Do the same for the lower lip part.

27
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:26,000
Copy and paste the upper and lower lip version.

28
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:29,000
Arrange them in the right position and turn the surface of the lip version.

29
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Let the lip version face out.

30
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:34,000
Then also merge the side of the newly created lip version on the lip version.

31
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:42,000
Use the free-format tool to merge them to the equal position.

32
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:45,000
Harden all the lip versions to make them look harder.

33
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:47,000
Open the model attribute.

34
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:49,000
Close the ground conflict in the attribute editor.

35
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:52,000
Return the gravity to 0.

36
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:54,000
Open the model.

37
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:58,000
Once the model is stable, turn off the hardening.

38
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:02,000
I'm going to use the Fusible Rigid fabric for the upper and lower lip versions.

39
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:05,000
This fabric is very hard and not easy to deform.

40
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:08,000
Then apply the Fulgrain Leather fabric to the side lip version.

41
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:10,000
It is not easy to bend and not easy to fold.

42
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:12,000
Use the sticky layer for the lip version.

43
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:16,000
In the preset attribute below, select Reinforcement Pocket Bone.

44
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:18,000
This is a very hard fabric.

45
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:21,000
As a sticky layer, tapping on the original fabric will increase the hardness.

46
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,000
Open the model.

47
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:27,000
You can see that the side version becomes closer to the original shape in the 2D window.

48
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:31,000
Then insert the forehead file carved in ZBrush.

49
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:34,000
If you have searched for the production method of the Chinese five dragon,

50
