52
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:43,000
Now put your mouth under your forehead.

53
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:48,000
Switch to the top view.

54
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,000
Adjust the top two versions.

55
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:51,000
Make them close to the shape of the forehead.

56
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:55,000
After modifying the top and back versions, adjust the side versions to simulate.

57
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:59,000
In order to prevent the position of the version from moving, you can temporarily freeze the top version.

58
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:02,000
In the 3D window, move all the box versions upwards.

59
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:04,000
Freeze other versions.

60
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:06,000
